    <panel_attributes>*Requirements*
-
*QOTX Posting*
- help post questions at a scheduled time
- formulate post to announce winners, and post it on a scheduled time

*QOTX Answer Retrieval*
let users answer
  - create private channel if not in one already
  - post to a qot-manager answer channel
  - store that post URL for easy retrieval
  - delete post URL storage for memory management
  
*QOTX Tracking*
keep track of open &amp; closed questions by number and URL 
keep history of correct answerers and their post &amp; ttime ( use latest edit or keep track of edits)
prompt qotd-manager for ruling on an answer?
- use those ruling to identify all correct answers (this will be used to identify the first 3 and a list of all the others)
- keep track of each poast's info (number, topic, hints, solutions, winners).

*QOTX Engagement*
- allow users to query for old questions and their info

*Memory*
Repl.it has 10GiB storage total for free. No memory management is needed yet, but perhaps allow deletion of information.

*Security*
- Roles for posting
-? Channel designations
- Ability to specify posting options per server

*Reaction Control*
- reaction white list per channel
- reaction black list per channel

Question tracking
- asker can mark a post as a question
- asker can mark question as answered
- answerer can mark a response as an answer,
  this can notify user, depending on user settings
- users can query bot for open or unanswered questions
style=wordwrap</panel_attributes>
